              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تجسس — tajassasa — \"to spy\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "تجسس الرجل على جيرانه. tajassasa ar-rajul ʿalā jīrānihi. The man spied on his neighbours."
